<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 111,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 111,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual receipts 111,000 and Saturday's 38,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts fell $1.50 to $2.00 from mid-session Friday. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				   Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		    51.00 -52.50	   52.00 -53.50</p>
<p>few				50.50 -53.00	   51.50 -54.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.	  41.00 -42.00	   42.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		   41.50 -47.00	   43.50 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		    45.00 -50.00	   46.00 -50.00</p>
